/-- 14:A2 — the arithmetic behind the triality centre: `S ≡ 1 (mod 3)` gives `3 ∣ Ω + 1` and `3 ∤ Ω − 1 = 4S`,
so the Carrier `𝔽_Ω` carries no element of order three in its unit group (that the centre lives in the
