/-! ## The angle–count dictionary (14:B2, C5, X2) -/
section dictionary

/-- 14:B2 [chart] — the angle–count dictionary: with the full cycle `2π ↔ 4S`, an angle `θ` is the chart face
of the count `θ/(2π) · 4S`: `π ↔ 2S`, `π/2 ↔ S`, `π/4 ↔ S/2` chronons; the count face is
